    [Test][v0.30.0] Backport Qwen3 QuaRot eagle3 graph mode test (#18023) (#18268)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Backports #18023 to `releases/v0.30.0`. The Qwen3-30B-QuaRot-eagle3
    performance test now uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode with the
    required Ascend compilation settings and updated performance baseline.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. This changes only an end-to-end test configuration.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    - `git diff --check upstream/releases/v0.30.0...HEAD` passed.
    - NPU end-to-end test was not run locally; it requires Ascend hardware.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: chenzeyu <2978509328@qq.com>
    Co-authored-by: lizhen <lizhen236@huawei.com>

